# Always pass project path

Every IntelliJ MCP tool accepts a project path parameter. Always include it when known.

- **Debugger & Index servers**: use `project_path` (snake_case), expects an absolute path.
- **GeneralIDE server**: use `projectPath` (camelCase), accepts absolute path or current working directory.

If you don't know the project path, ask the user or use `get_repositories` (GeneralIDE) to discover it.
